<title>UK: Norwest sets $300 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Norwest sets $300 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORWEST CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $300 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +5 BP     PAY DATE    13.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.912    FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    99.912</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.05	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
